Z||000007||My7Fieros||09-18-2001||04:02 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>yeah, Voyager ended last season, when they destroyed the borg and got home..<P>there's a new star trek series starting this season, that I'm really looking forward to.. it takes place a few years after star trek: first contact<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Actually the new show is called "Enterprise" and I believe its supposed to be <I>before</I> Cpt. Kirk....Star Treks version of a prequel of sorts. Scott Backula (the Quantum Leap guy) plays the captain of the USS Enterprise...the one <I>before</I> the Enterprise that Shatner had.<BR>BTW why did fiero_hunter85 post pics of his car on this post?<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||Formula88||09-18-2001||10:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B>  [QUOTE]Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR>[b]yeah, Voyager ended last season, when they destroyed the borg and got home..<P>there's a new star trek series starting this season, that I'm really looking forward to.. it takes place a few years after star trek: first contact<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Actually the new show is called "Enterprise" and I believe its supposed to be <I>before</I> Cpt. Kirk....Star Treks version of a prequel of sorts. Scott Backula (the Quantum Leap guy) plays the captain of the USS Enterprise...the one <I>before</I> the Enterprise that Shatner had.<BR>BTW why did fiero_hunter85 post pics of his car on this post?<P>[/B][/QUOTE]<P>You are correct.  Remember, the events in "First Contact" happened <I>before</I> Kirk and Spock.  You know, Picard did that time travel thing that they love to do all the time...<P>Enterprise is set in the mid 22nd century, about 2150 I think, and the "Enterprise," from what I can gather, is the first warp equipped ship for Starfleet.  It has the potential to really rock, but I fear Brandon Braga and Ronald D. Moore will screw it up just like they've screwed up every other form of Trek since Gene Roddenberry died.||||reg||6
Z||000009||Fiero5||09-19-2001||03:35 PM||||Being a huge Star Trek fan, and having a large Star Trek collection, etc, I hope that this isn't going to be some goofy attempt to do another Star Trek show.<BR>It sounds promising, though I don't like having Scott Bakula as captain. He has allready established himself in a sci-fi series.<BR>But, I guess I have to live with it. Maybe the fan response will be like mine, and get him killed by Klingons somewhere down the line, and another captain played by a more unknown actor can step in.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.startrek.com/launch/art/hub_mainpic.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.startrek.com/launch/images/enterprise_beauty.jpg"> <P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                <IMG SRC="http://a1040.g.akamai.net/f/1040/759/1h/206.29.192.139/info/pics/sept11.jpg">                             <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||6
